  "repository": "omacom/omarchy",
  "number": 2331,
  "checked_at": "2026-09-21T11:56:41.772473+00:00",
  "title": "Keyboard brightness multimedia keys support",
  "author": "satyapraneet63",
  "head_sha": "4946ce781bc19d76b95a59fc3e292dd186b75cb0",
  "base_sha": "1e859d37cb7fef6ac687442dc1fe515d01d1302d",
  "base_ref": "master",
  "updated_at": "2026-09-18T08:34:37Z",
  "state": "closed",
  "body": "I use a 2019 macbook air and the keyboard keys for backlight do not work out of the box. Made a issues post and a discussion on it and got some feedback.\r\nAdding my commit to the default media.conf could help with the out of the box experience.\r\n\r\n## Possible Issues:\r\nmy keyboard uses apple::kbd_backlight call. I have seen another person have a smc::kbd_backlight call. We could make the vendor into a variable and pass into it, but I do not know how to call it.\r\n\r\n## References:\r\n[#2291](https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy/issues/2291)\r\nhttps://github.com/basecamp/omarchy/pull/1779\r\n",
  "draft": false,
  "files": [
    {
      "sha": "82b238dbfab32dab31e76c8894d17b8283dc419c",
      "filename": "default/hypr/bindings/media.conf",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 9,
      "deletions": 0,
      "changes": 9,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/blob/4946ce781bc19d76b95a59fc3e292dd186b75cb0/default%2Fhypr%2Fbindings%2Fmedia.conf",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/omacom/omarchy/raw/4946ce781bc19d76b95a59fc3e292dd186b75cb0/default%2Fhypr%2Fbindings%2Fmedia.conf",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/omacom/omarchy/contents/default%2Fhypr%2Fbindings%2Fmedia.conf?ref=4946ce781bc19d76b95a59fc3e292dd186b75cb0",
      "patch": "@@ -23,3 +23,12 @@ bindld = , XF86AudioPrev, Previous track, exec, $osdclient --playerctl previous\n \n # Switch audio output with Super + Mute\n bindld = SUPER, XF86AudioMute, Switch audio output, exec, omarchy-cmd-audio-switch\n+\n+#Laptop multimedia keys for keyboard brightness (with OSD)\n+$keysswayosd = $osdclient --custom-progress=$(awk \"BEGIN {print $(brightnessctl --device=apple::kbd_backlight get)/255}\") --custom-icon=input-keyboard\n+bindeld = ,XF86KbdBrightnessDown, Keyboard Brightness down, exec, brightnessctl --device=apple::kbd_backlight set 10%- && $keysswayosd\n+bindeld = ,XF86KbdBrightnessUp, Keyboard Brightness up, exec, brightnessctl --device=apple::kbd_backlight set +10% && $keysswayosd\n+\n+# Precise 1% multimedia adjustments with Alt modifier\n+bindeld = ALT, XF86KbdBrightnessDown, Keyboard Brightness down precise, exec, brightnessctl --device=apple::kbd_backlight set 1%- && $keysswayosd\n+bindeld = ALT, XF86KbdBrightnessUp, Keyboard Brightness up precise, exec, brightnessctl --device=apple::kbd_backlight set +1% && $keysswayosd"
    }
  ],
